  "definitions_zh_TW": [
    {
      "text": "1.用肩膀挑東西。[例]擔水、擔柴\n\t\n2.扁擔：竹製或木製的扁長形，用來挑物的器具。\n\t\n3.負責、承當。[例]擔當、擔任、擔保\n",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "1082",
      "verbatim": true
    },
    {
      "text": "1.用扁擔所挑的物品。[例]擔子\n2.肩負的責任。[例]重擔\n3.量詞。計算成挑物品的單位。[例]一擔米、兩擔柴、三擔賀禮",
      "lang": "zh-Hant-TW",
      "register": "dictionary",
      "source_id": "moe-tw-concised-dictionary-2014-20260626",
      "source_entry_id": "1100",
      "verbatim": true
    }
